{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"cd9414d3db662f5aa7a2fbe7aa45b3743e78d45da85f67aad36be0a6ea9aa0c2","occurred_at":"2026-11-21T20:47:30Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[99,102]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"DEPENDENCY_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"(?P<directive>Wants|Requires|Requisite|BindsTo|PartOf|Conflicts|\"\n    r\"WantedBy|RequiredBy|Also|Upholds|OnFailure|OnSuccess|Triggers|\"\n    r\"TriggersBy|Unit|Service)\\s*=\\s*(?P<value>.*)\")","reason":"The current DEPENDENCY_RE whitelist omits systemd's StopPropagatedFrom= and PropagatesStopTo= directives. A foreign unit with StopPropagatedFrom=crq-tick.service is therefore not seen by the dependency scan, so the fence's stop of crq-tick.service can propagate and stop an active co-tenant. This is a concrete omission in the existing dependency scan, not a new contract requirement; adding the two directives to the alternation is the smallest fix.","target":"c144c51fac80b5af5b01d7e8cbfa5629f7b2c264"},"finding_id":"c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442","previous_event_id":"73aae7f12d7d2061f6a81f8f1e4753cdc9270387b53996e440ed84c8e92482ab","review_id":"b08452801c153d71823e0063057ca8526a7754e9b9085e055e498d2c928878b1"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442:ecdf9372e0ad20bd442eb7c37d57a49472043863b3deafe5fdb1b9e74e8c15c2"}